g an insightful and compelling musical world of interlocking and fractured components. Drawing upon his study with Lupo at Berlin's Dubplates & Mastering, plus years spent curating the Enjoy artspace in Leeds, Treanor's sound uses off centred rhythmic arrangements, referencing the dynamics of garage and techno as much as Fluxus and Dada cut-ups.\r\n\r\nSince 2015 Treanor has focused on his solo sound works, developing musical environments for improvisations within his live performances. He has recently signed to Annex artist agency who are managing bookings for his live shows. Please direct all booking enquiries for Europe, UK, Asia, Australia to: chloe@annexagency.co.uk","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:3462683","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/3462683-Rian-Treanor","type":"artist","urls":["http://www.riantreanor.com","https://riantreanor.bandcamp.com"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/8207960/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"8207960","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:8207960","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/8207960-Honey-Oat","type":"artist","urls":[]}},"/api/discogs/artist/82294/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"82294","image":"https://i.discogs.com/J0ICbHyUdNYLNgkjSsnkTAG69haSDTuZ6lGKANVlQRI/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:594/w:600/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTgyMjk0/LTE2NjI2MzkyODIt/MjY3OS5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/rLGhJd5_PgixQ9PC_LOnC8cIKGfZvbAHUvAJ2NGpZO4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTgyMjk0/LTE2NjI2MzkyODIt/MjY3OS5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"Born December 7th. 1949, in Pomona, California. Tom Waits first album, \"Closing Time\", was released in 1973. A contemporary artist, Waits is mostly known for his lyrical and poe